{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115190","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1111519001:0":{"text":"Soren is unaffected! Chippy, have everyone move next to Soren!","source_cn":"索恩没有受到影响……满满！快把大家拉到索恩跟前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF8625E1507EABAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111519002:0":{"text":"Soren has the Mark of the Setting Sun... If we stay close, we can resist Phraesto's magic!","source_cn":"索恩身体内有残阳神的力量，待在他周围，可以抵御普鲁斯托...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9982B06373FD4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111519003:0":{"text":"On it!","source_cn":"知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319E0B217B809E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111519004:0":{"text":"Planning on hiding behind that child for the rest of your short lives?","source_cn":"所以，你们最终决定在那个孩子边上躲一辈子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9A6BF2670048DBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111519005:0":{"text":"Of course not! We'll defeat you!","source_cn":"才不会呢！我们要打败你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF66C25D91BB6520B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111519006:1":{"text":"Why such hostility? I, Phraesto, am the Hypogean that can remedy this world's sadness.","source_cn":"为何要对我充满敌意呢？我，普鲁斯托，是可以让世人获得幸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43E7D5327140F0F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111519007:0":{"text":"In my illusions, departed loved ones return home to their kin with open arms.","source_cn":"在我的幻术中，逝去的至亲会再次展开双臂，给予拥抱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3774D1A7BB87B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111519008:1":{"text":"Scorned lovers reunite and never betray one another again.","source_cn":"分别的恋人也会重归于好，永不背叛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51DD375D87A639DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111519009:1":{"text":"No one needs endure the travesties of illness, poverty, or war. All may live in peace and prosperity while flourishing in everlasting youth.","source_cn":"人们不必再忍受病痛、穷苦、战争，所有人都会长久地生活在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0750865F182E2B64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111519010:1":{"text":"If you would like to assign a duration to the length of these generous illusions, I offer my lifespan as the criterion.","source_cn":"如果要为我的幻术附上期限，那么，我愿以自己的寿命作为标准。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x401386C21FB9DB8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111519011:1":{"text":"And as a Hypogean, I am immortal!","source_cn":"身为恶魔，我的寿命是永远！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7368635FACFAB296","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111519012:1":{"text":"The one known as Merlin—do you not wish for eternal bliss?","source_cn":"继承了梅林之名的魔法师！你不想拥有永恒的幸福吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x456F0E0175835B90","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The one known as Merlin—do you not wish for eternal bliss?","female":"The one known as Merlin—do you not wish for eternal bliss?","variant_male_record_index":"123360","variant_female_record_index":"123361","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1111519012":{"text":"The one known as Merlin—do you not wish for eternal bliss?","source_cn":"继承了梅林之名的魔法师！你不想拥有永恒的幸福吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x456F0E0175835B90","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The one known as Merlin—do you not wish for eternal bliss?","female":"The one known as Merlin—do you not wish for eternal bliss?","variant_male_record_index":"123360","variant_female_record_index":"123361","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111519013:0":{"text":"Are illusions that last all eternity not just another form of reality?","source_cn":"永恒的虚假，不正是另一种真实吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF8F79D9AA3E923","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are illusions that last all eternity not just another form of reality?","female":"Are illusions that last all eternity not just another form of reality?","variant_male_record_index":"123362","variant_female_record_index":"123363","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111519015:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I've heard enough of this nonsense.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2960AD322A7736C8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I've heard enough of this nonsense.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I've heard enough of this nonsense.","variant_male_record_index":"123366","variant_female_record_index":"123367","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111519016:0":{"text":"I'm prepared.","source_cn":"我已经做好准备了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC56F451664C618E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm prepared.","female":"I'm prepared.","variant_male_record_index":"123368","variant_female_record_index":"123369","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1111519016":{"text":"I'm prepared.","source_cn":"我已经做好准备了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC56F451664C618E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm prepared.","female":"I'm prepared.","variant_male_record_index":"123368","variant_female_record_index":"123369","document_title":"","docume